    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Along the way of TWA...\nETTY\nCARODE KRIOMPHE\n3 - Paris\n/ Stapding in the heart\nof Paris, one of the\nworld capitals served\nby frequent TWA flights,\nthis famous Arch\nat the head of the\nbeautiful Champs-Elysées\nsymbolizes the\nFrench love of freedom.\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nU.S. A. • EUROPE\nAFRICA • ASIA",
